[CENTER]
[SIZE=6][COLOR=#00FF88][B]⚡ UptifyBridge[/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]
[SIZE=4][B]Official Minecraft Integration for [URL='https://uptify.site']Uptify.site[/URL][/B][/SIZE]
[COLOR=#888888]Status Pages • In-Game Suggestions • Zero-Click Account Linking • Discord Webhooks[/COLOR]

[IMG]https://uptify.site/icon.jpg[/IMG]

[B]Supports: Paper • Purpur • Spigot • Folia (1.16 - 1.21.x+)[/B]
[B]Java 17 & 21+ Compatible | Zero NMS[/B]
[/CENTER]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][COLOR=#00FF88][B]🌟 Features Overview[/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]

[B][COLOR=#55FF55]🔗 Zero-Click Account Linking (/link)[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*]Generates a secure 15-minute one-time link token with a clickable chat button.
[*][B]0-Click Instant Link:[/B] Players already logged into Uptify are linked automatically with zero extra clicks!
[*]Unregistered players see their Minecraft skin head, can log in or create an account, and are auto-linked upon authentication.
[*]In-game background poller immediately sends an emerald notification when verification succeeds.
[/LIST]

[B][COLOR=#55FF55]💡 In-Game Feedback & Suggestions (/suggest <idea>)[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*]Players can submit server suggestions and feedback directly in-game.
[*]Syncs live to your server's [URL='https://uptify.site/feedback']Uptify Feedback Board[/URL].
[*]Broadcasts directly to your staff Discord channel with Discord Webhook cards.
[*][B]Anti-Spam Verification:[/B] Requires players to link their account first.
[/LIST]

[B][COLOR=#55FF55]📊 Live Network Status (/status)[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*]Displays real-time node latencies (Proxy, Survival, Bedrock Gateway, etc.).
[*]Shows active maintenance incidents and severity warnings.
[*]Clickable link directly to your public status page on Uptify.
[/LIST]

[B][COLOR=#55FF55]🧩 PlaceholderAPI Support[/COLOR][/B]
Display live status on your TAB, Scoreboard, or Chat formatting:
[LIST]
[*][B]%uptify_status%[/B] - OPERATIONAL, DEGRADED, or OUTAGE
[*][B]%uptify_status_colored%[/B] - Colored status (Operational, Degraded, Outage)
[*][B]%uptify_status_project%[/B] - Configured status project ID
[*][B]%uptify_feedback_project%[/B] - Configured feedback project ID
[*][B]%uptify_version%[/B] - Plugin version
[/LIST]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][COLOR=#00FF88][B]⚙️ Configuration (config.yml)[/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]
[CODE=yaml]
# Uptify API endpoint
api-base-url: "https://api.uptify.site"

# Status Project ID (for /status)
status-project-id: "YOUR_STATUS_PROJECT_ID"

# Feedback Project ID (for /suggest)
feedback-project-id: "YOUR_FEEDBACK_PROJECT_ID"

enable-link-polling: true
polling-interval-seconds: 3
cache-status-interval-seconds: 60
[/CODE]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][COLOR=#00FF88][B]🎮 Commands & Permissions[/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]
[TABLE]
[TR]
[TH]Command[/TH]
[TH]Aliases[/TH]
[TH]Description[/TH]
[TH]Permission[/TH]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]/link[/TD]
[TD]/uptifylink[/TD]
[TD]Generates a clickable link to verify your Uptify account[/TD]
[TD]uptify.use (Default)[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]/suggest <idea>[/TD]
[TD]/feedback, /idea[/TD]
[TD]Submits feedback to your server's Uptify board[/TD]
[TD]uptify.use (Default)[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]/status[/TD]
[TD]/uptifystatus[/TD]
[TD]Displays live node latency and incident alerts[/TD]
[TD]uptify.use (Default)[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]/uptify test[/TD]
[TD]—[/TD]
[TD]Tests API connection and measures latency ping[/TD]
[TD]uptify.admin (OP)[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]/uptify reload[/TD]
[TD]—[/TD]
[TD]Reloads config.yml[/TD]
[TD]uptify.admin (OP)[/TD]
[/TR]
[/TABLE]

